# map = new Map; map.set(key, value); for (const pair of map) ..
# A step of a pattern over a pair reads the key or the value by its index. The index says so only where the steps of the pattern take place after place from the first on:
# a step that claims the second place and is the first to run finds the key, and the step of `...rest` runs once for each place from its own on.
